    "created_at": "2016-09-26T21:04:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-26T21:04:25Z",
    "body": "To be clear, the OffscreenCanvas interface is supposed to have transferToImageBitmap, and the ImageBitmapRenderingContext interface is supposed to have transferFromImageBitmap.\n\nThis To/From naming that we had agreed upon is clearer.  Could Gecko make transferImageBitmap an alias for transferFromImageBitmap, and deprecate the former?\n\nWhat exactly has shipped in Gecko? Please don't ship OffscreenCanvas until it is spec'ed.  There's a bunch of details that need to be tuned, which may affect inter-op.  I intend to post the main OffscreenCanvas PR in a few days.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/249697092/reactions",
