    "created_at": "2016-09-26T21:15:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-26T21:15:15Z",
    "body": "(not that Google waits for stuff being spec'ed before shipping ;))\n\nImageBitmapRenderingContext is enabled, not OffscreenCanvas. Whether or not exposing it to the web was a mistake is a different question, but there we are now.\ntransferFromImageBitmap has different meaning to me than transferImageBitmap. \nThe latter hints that the data from the original ImageBitmap is nuked, since that is how transferring works. _From_ doesn't really have similar mean, or I don't read it so. In fact, I don't know what transferFromImageBitmap actually means.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
