    "created_at": "2016-09-26T21:46:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-26T21:46:57Z",
    "body": "Personally I do not feel that strongly about the name.  However, those who suggested the name change should chime-in. The name change request came from the WebGL WG face to face meeting in Jan 2016, which I did not attend.  In the meeting minutes, it does not say who raised this issue. The request was relayed to me by @kenrussell who stated that the new name has support from other implementers and that the rationale is to clearly indicate that the argument is the source of the transfer operation, as opposed to OffscrenCanvas.transferToImageBitmap, where the argument is the destination of the transfer.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
