    "created_at": "2016-09-26T21:55:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-26T21:55:13Z",
    "body": "If I remember correctly, Microsoft suggested the transferToImageBitmap/transferFromImageBitmap symmetry. It sounded like a good idea to me. While I see your point, I think that having the from/to explicitly mentioned in the method's name is better than not having it, and that the documentation for each should indicate exactly what is done. I recommend not renaming the method.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
