    "created_at": "2016-09-26T22:33:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-26T22:33:35Z",
    "body": "It's also important to recognize that \"transferX\" is spec jargon that web developers are not familiar with, whereas a name like \"transferFromX\" is at least evocative of the normal concept of transferring something (in this case the underlying data) from the ImageBitmap to elsewhere.\n",
