    "created_at": "2016-09-26T23:09:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-26T23:09:21Z",
    "body": "Well, there isn't and shouldn't be symmetry between canvas.transferToImageBitmap and transferFromImageBitmap since they do very different things. \n_To_ does a copy/move and the current _From_ does actual transfer, it does set ImageBitmap's  [[Detached]] to true. So I think it is rather confusing to hint symmetry in the name, when there isn't symmetry in the functionality.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
