    "created_at": "2016-09-26T23:17:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-26T23:19:23Z",
    "body": "Though, I guess since transferToImageBitmap is still rather vaguely defined I could be wrong here.\n\nBut I do read the proposal so that transferToImageBitmap can be used several times in a row and each ImageBitmap end up using the same underlying data. So nothing gets [[Detach]]'ed internally.\n",
